OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and clear spells this
OL,7,Fevening and overnight. Under the
OL,8,Fclearer spells some mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches are likely to form in prone
OL,10,Frural spots, with areas of low cloud
OL,11,Fby dawn. Milder than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloud builds through the
OL,14,Fmorning with a band of light rain
OL,15,Fmoving across all parts during the
OL,16,Fafternoon, then clearing late in the
OL,17,Fevening. Temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
