OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter Saturday. Breezy on
OL,7,FSunday with a band of rain arriving
OL,8,Flater, after a fine start to the day.
OL,9,FFine and dry on Monday. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average.
